meta {
  name: Stress Scenarios
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/risk/stress
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  Revalues the book under every scenario in config/stress-scenarios.yml, worst loss first.

  FACTOR scenarios propagate a market move through each name's beta and pull correlations toward
  `correlation-override` — correlations converging to one IS the crisis, and a stress test that
  keeps the calm-market matrix will always report that the hedged book is fine.

  Breaches publish a STRESS_LIMIT_BREACH event on analytics.risk-alerts, which the gateway fans
  out over /ws/alerts to the UI banner.
}
